nt of  creator don mancini or  long-time chucky voice actor brad dorf  on top of a new creative team the remake  also features a deeply unsettling  redesign for the series iconic  good guys doll which will be called a  buddy doll in the new film  adding a new level of wide-eyed  innocence to the serial killer possessed  toy hi  i'm chucky wanna play the conjuring  cinematic universe continues to grow  with a third entry in the annabelle  series promising that 2019 will be a  banner year for horror movies about  creepy dolls  the new installment is a follow-up to  the 2017 prequel annabelle creation  and is set for release on july 3rd the  new movie will bring the series forward  in time to the conjuring territory with  appearances from patrick wilson  and vera farmiga's ed and lorraine  warren who eventually end up in  possession of the haunted doll  where's the doll now someplace safe  the story for the sequel has been  described as annabelle meets night at  the museum  it'll feature the haunted doll exerting  its twisted influence inside of the  warren's cluttered artifact room  bringing evil to life to terrorize the  couple's young daughter and her  babysitters  in other words it's time for the  warren's kid to take up the family  business of hunting demons this summer  whether she's ready for the job or not  tom holland's spider-man is set to  continue his adventures in the marvel  cinematic universe with a second  standalone film on july 5th  2019. after taking some detours with the  avengers and  getting killed for a little while the  new movie will take the web slinger back  to basics with another hit of action  comedy from the creative team behind  spider-man homecoming  despite the familiarity behind the  scenes the new spider-man adventure will  feel different from all the characters  previous movies  taking him outside of his queen's  neighborhood and across the ocean to  europe  while he's there he'll face off with the  villainous mysterio  a trickster c